SERENITY UAV — TOOLS & UTILITIES LICENSING
===========================================

This folder is MIXED (owner rule 2026-10-04, see below):

* Analysis, verification, CI and utility tools — **MIT** (full text below and
  ../LICENSES/MIT).
* Tools that write or render hardware (SCAD/STL/FCStd/KiCad output or figures
  of geometry) — **CERN-OHL-W 2.0**: bake_hull_frame, build_head_shell,
  cargo_layout_fit, export_landing_gear_stls, gen_cargo_void_formers,
  middle_layout_fit, nacelle_hollow_profile, nacelle_housing_profile,
  open_mating_faces, purge_stale_fcstd_objects, tilt_actuator_options,
  wing_airfoil_variants, wing_section_figure. Each file's header is authoritative.
* Documents in this folder — **CC BY-SA 4.0**.

